- `VerifyMissionEvent.VerifyMissionSuccess/Failure` → `VerifyMissionEvent.NavigateToPost/ShowSnackbar`
- `WritePostEvent.VerifyFailure` → `WritePostEvent.ShowVerifyFailureDialog`

